    "title": "Seedling Garden Club announces August Yard of the Month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "thecrossroads.news\nwebsite\nSwainsboro\nSeedling Garden Club announces August Yard of the Month\nBy thecrossroadsnews,\n19 hours agoThe Seedling Garden Club proudly announces that the August 2025 Yard of the Month is the home of Lacey and Perry Bishop located on Old Nunez Road in Swainsboro. Lacey and Perry enjoy their yard, especially in the summer, to help Emanuel County stay beautiful. The Seedling Garden Club wants to honor homeowners and organizations that personally work so diligently with pride and love to maintain their yards. Nominations for Yard of the Month are welcomed for each month and can be called in to 478-494-6754 or 478-494-2752.",
